3. Something wrong in it? Reply to the email before you sign and we fix it.
',
  '<p class="gd-p">Your signed agreements, uploads and government forms are under Documents. Some forms are filled for you; Forms C and D are signed on screen with your witnesses beside you.</p><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-sign-everything-at-once" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sign everything at once</h2><p class="gd-p">Everything you sign on screen is in one place: Home shows how many are signed (&quot;2 of 5 signed&quot;) and opens it with Check and sign.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Check and sign</b> on Home (or open <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/owner/sign</span>). The list at the top shows each document: signed, in this package, or done elsewhere (Forms C and D, the bank debit).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Check the key values: your name, address, each car with its VIN and plate, your fees and Revenue Share. Something wrong? Press <b class="gd-ui">Fix</b> next to it, change it, and come back.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Open any document to read it word for word: the agreements, the schedules and Forms A and B. The official registry forms are not in it: they are printed and signed in ink.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A code is optional: press <b class="gd-ui">Verify by code</b> if you want the certificate to say a 6-digit code to your phone or email confirmed it was you (it is asked first only if CarmaCars turns it on).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Tick that you read the documents, draw your initials in the box beside each confirmation the Enrollment Agreement asks for, and tick the two consents (to sign electronically, to get your records electronically).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Draw your signature in the box with your finger, a pen or the mouse, then press <b class="gd-ui">Sign all</b>. One signature is applied to each document; CarmaCars countersigns at the same moment and every signed copy is in Documents.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div class="gd-t">Each signed copy ends with a certificate of completion: when and where each step was done, and whether a code confirmed it was you. Anyone holding a copy can check it at carmacars.ca/verify.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-read-your-agreements-before-approval" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Read your agreements before approval</h2><p class="gd-p">You can read both agreements as soon as you apply, before we approve your terms.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Read your agreements</b> on Home (Documents and each car&#39;s Onboarding checklist link to it too).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Each document is filled in from your application: your name, address and cars. It is marked &quot;Terms pending approval&quot;: the fees, the Revenue Share and the agreement numbers read Pending approval until we set them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Something wrong? Press <b class="gd-ui">Fix</b> next to it. The Sign button stays off until we approve your terms; then Home shows <b class="gd-ui">Check and sign</b> and we email you.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><div>Two owners: A car with a second owner on its ownership? Each owner named in the Title Schedule signs. The other owner gets their own link by email and signs the same documents on their phone or computer, the same way: the documents read, the confirmations initialled, the consents and their drawn signature (a code to their email only if they choose it or CarmaCars turns it on). The agreements take effect when the last owner signs; CarmaCars countersigns then.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Cannot draw a signature (for example with a disability)? Call us: an Admin can let you type your name instead.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Form A (the trust declaration) is for cars under the Co-Registrant or Transfer method; Form B (the lease summary) for cars under a Lease method. No witness is needed: they are in the same package. You can also sign one on its own page from Documents.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Every agreement is signed on screen, with the e-signature. A copy signed on paper is not accepted (a document you signed on paper before November 2026 stays on file as Signed on paper).</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-we-set-up-your-car-for-you" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">We set up your car for you</h2><p class="gd-p">When our team enters your car for you, you get one email: review the details and sign.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">No sign-in yet? The email has a link to choose your password. It works once, for 24 hours; after that use Forgot password on the sign-in page.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Open <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/owner/review</span> (Home has <b class="gd-ui">Review or correct your details</b>). Check your phone and address, and each car: plate, colour, odometer, your insurer and your lender. The terms we agreed are shown too.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Something wrong? Correct it and press <b class="gd-ui">Save corrections</b>. Your documents are filled in again and we are told. A term you did not agree to: message us before you sign.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Everything right? Press <b class="gd-ui">Everything is right: sign</b> and sign once.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-sign-an-updated-vehicle-schedule" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sign an updated Vehicle Schedule</h2><p class="gd-p">When we agree new terms for a car you already signed for, you sign an updated Vehicle Schedule. Home shows it first.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open it from Home or the email. It shows what changes (now and updated) and the date it applies from.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Read the text, then sign the same way as your agreements: tick that you read it, initial the updated terms, tick the two consents, draw your signature and press <b class="gd-ui">Sign</b> (a code to your phone or email is optional).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Your current terms stay until you sign. After that, your invoices and statements use the new ones from the date. The signed copy, with its certificate of completion, is in Documents.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-form-c-on-screen-with-your-witness-beside-you" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Form C on screen, with your witness beside you</h2><p class="gd-p">Form C is the lender or lessor permission for a financed or leased car. It needs one witness, and you can sign it on screen when your witness is with you.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Documents. Under Forms to sign with witnesses, press <b class="gd-ui">Sign Form C on screen</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Tick that you read the form (a code to your phone or email is optional, unless CarmaCars turns it on).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Draw your initials beside each of the three acknowledgments, tick the two consents and draw your signature.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Hand the device to your witness, another adult. They type their full name and tick the statement &quot;I witnessed (your name) sign in my presence.&quot; Press <b class="gd-ui">Sign Form C</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/documents/form-c/4898eb96-0cce-4efc-9fdd-740b4b4e9ad3</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:790/980"><img src="/guides/img/owner-16-form-c-screen-desktop-faa92983.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="790" height="980"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:5.7%;top:13.6%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:32.9%;top:55.1%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:6.3%;top:82.2%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-form-d-on-screen-with-your-two-witnesses-beside-you" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Form D on screen, with your two witnesses beside you</h2><p class="gd-p">Form D is a limited power of attorney, once for all your cars. It needs two witnesses, and you sign it on screen with both of them beside you.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Documents. Under Forms to sign with witnesses, press <b class="gd-ui">Sign Form D on screen</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Tick that you read the form (a code to your phone or email is optional, unless CarmaCars turns it on), tick the two consents and draw your signature.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Hand the device to your first witness, another adult. They type their full name and tick the statement &quot;I witnessed (your name) sign in my presence.&quot; Then the same for your second witness.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Sign Form D</b>. CarmaCars signs Part 2 at the same moment, and the signed copy is in Documents.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>A paper copy is no longer accepted: Forms C and D are signed on screen only. A form you sent as a photo before November 2026 stays on file.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-government-forms-filled-for-you" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Government forms filled for you</h2><p class="gd-p">Each car&#39;s registry forms are prepared from your records, only the ones its onboarding method needs (013-1155 and 013-0169, for example, only for a Lease through a new corporation). Until we load the official PDF, you get a data sheet with the values.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Documents and choose a form marked &quot;Official form, filled for you&quot;.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Download the filled form</b> and check each value.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Print it and sign it in ink. It is the official ServiceOntario form exactly as ServiceOntario publishes it, with only its empty text boxes filled in. Its boxes to tick and its signatures are done by hand, at the registry office or before you go, as we tell you.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/documents/forms/4d54a524-c28d-4bc4-8ad3-dd9558100a81/official</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/732"><img src="/guides/img/owner-13-official-form-desktop-48614913.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="732"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:22.2%;top:29.5%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>ON00453 (a company&#39;s registrant number) is an Adobe form: open it in Adobe Acrobat Reader (free) to see and print it. Other PDF viewers show a blank page, as they do with the form downloaded from ServiceOntario.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>Official registry forms are never signed on screen. You pay ServiceOntario, the inspection station and the appraiser directly.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-the-agreement-for-your-deal" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The agreement for your deal</h2><p class="gd-p">Your agreement is filled in from the terms we agreed with you. We email you a link when it is ready: <b class="gd-ui">Read and sign</b> opens it in your portal, and you sign once for every document.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Fleet Supplier Lease Agreement</b>: if your corporation leases cars to CarmaCars. It lists each car with its tier (Regular or Troubled), its monthly lease and its delivery date. Each car&#39;s tier is set once, when it is delivered. You pay CarmaCars no fees. We pay in arrears on the 10th: a car&#39;s first payment comes one full month after delivery, and part months are paid by the day, with the calculation on your statement.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Referral Override Agreement</b>: if you referred another owner. It sets the override we pay you on their cars (out of our share, never theirs) and what you can see of those cars. Find it under <b class="gd-ui">Cars</b>: Sign your Referral Override Agreement.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Something wrong in it? Reply to the email before you sign and we fix it.</div></li></ol></div></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'for-partner-rental-companies', 'chapter', 'documents-and-forms', 'A partner rental company uses this same portal. CarmaCars rents out your cars, keeps its commission and pays you the rest each month.

## Your partner portal

1. Home shows your partner number, our commission and your cars. CarmaCars adds your cars once we agree which ones join.
2. Cars shows each car and, on its Bookings tab, its rentals. There are no program fees, so Money has no Invoices tab.
3. Statements and Payouts: a statement for each month and the payment of your share.

## Sign the partner agreement

Press **Check and sign** on Home, or open **Documents** > **Partner agreement**.

1. Check the key values at the top: who signs, your address, our commission, your insurance and your cars. The agreement is filled in from your partner record; open it to read it in full.
2. Something wrong? Tell us before you sign and we fix it.
3. Press **Sign**. Your name on file is your signature (or press **Draw instead**). CarmaCars countersigns at once and the signed copy is in Documents.

> Tip: Your insurance covers your cars. We remind you before it expires: send us the new certificate and we record the new expiry.

> Tip: Prefer paper? Ask us for a copy, sign it and send us the scan. We record it and it counts the same.
', 'For partner rental companies', 'The partner portal, the partner agreement, statements and payouts.',
  'A partner rental company uses this same portal. CarmaCars rents out your cars, keeps its commission and pays you the rest each month.

## Your partner portal

1. Home shows your partner number, our commission and your cars. CarmaCars adds your cars once we agree which ones join.
2. Cars shows each car and, on its Bookings tab, its rentals. There are no program fees, so Money has no Invoices tab.
3. Statements and Payouts: a statement for each month and the payment of your share.

## Sign the partner agreement

Press **Check and sign** on Home, or open **Documents** > **Partner agreement**.

1. Check the key values at the top: who signs, your address, our commission, your insurance and your cars. The agreement is filled in from your partner record; open it to read it in full.
2. Something wrong? Tell us before you sign and we fix it.
3. Press **Sign**. Your name on file is your signature (or press **Draw instead**). CarmaCars countersigns at once and the signed copy is in Documents.

> Tip: Your insurance covers your cars. We remind you before it expires: send us the new certificate and we record the new expiry.

> Good to know: Every agreement is signed on screen, with the e-signature. A copy signed on paper is not accepted.
',
