your cars. We remind you before it expires: send us the new certificate and we record the new expiry.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Every agreement is signed on screen, with the e-signature. A copy signed on paper is not accepted.</div></aside></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'quick-reference', 'reference', 'notices-profile-and-leaving', '### Where things are

| Item | What it is for |
| --- | --- |
| **Home** | The next thing to do first, then what you earned this month, cars out, the next payout and fees due, your cars and what is coming up |
| **Cars** | **Your cars** (each car: terms, checklist, uploads, photos, Leaving) and **Bookings** (all bookings, the calendar, Book my own car) |
| **Money** | **Statements** (this month so far, then one a month, Download PDF), **Payouts** (what was paid and when), **Invoices** (fee invoices and Pay $...) |
| **Documents** | Agreements, forms, Forms C and D |
| **Account** | **Profile** (contact details, password), **Banking** (automatic debit, where we pay you), **Notifications** (our messages) |

### Top tasks

1. *Sign everything at once:* **Home** > **Check and sign**
2. *Set up the monthly debit:* **Account** > **Banking** > **Set up pre-authorized debit**
3. *Pay an invoice now:* **Money** > **Invoices**, the invoice, then **Pay $...**
4. *Payout details:* **Account** > **Banking** > **Where we pay you**
5. *Forms C and D:* **Documents** > **Sign Form C on screen instead** or **Take a photo of the signed page**
6. *Book your own car:* **Cars** > **Bookings** > **Book my own car**
7. *New listing photos:* **Cars**, the car, then **Take new photos**
8. *Leave the program:* **Cars**, the car, then **Give notice**

### If something goes wrong

| What you see | What to do |
| --- | --- |
| **A link says it expired** | Links in our emails work for 24 hours, once. Press **Send me a new link** on that page. |
| **"Error 1102" on a page** | A short limit on our web host. Reload the page. You are still signed in. |
| **"That email and password do not match an account."** | Check the address, or use **Set a new password** on the sign-in page. |
| **A debit was returned** | You get an email with the reason. Insufficient funds: keep the money in the account for the retry, or pay the invoice from its page. Any other reason: pay from the invoice''s page or set up a new account under Account > Banking. |
', 'Quick reference', 'One page with the essentials.',
