### Search everything from the header

The **Search** button at the top of every page (or press **/** or **Ctrl K**) finds pages, cars, places and guides, and your records: bookings and requests by number, renter name, email, phone or plate, renters, owners and cars. Arrows choose, **Enter** opens, **Esc** closes. Each person finds only what their role may open.

## Choose a portal

An account with more than one portal (Admin and the staff portal, an owner who also invests) opens **Choose a portal** after signing in: one card for each portal, with what is there and your role in it. The portal you opened last comes first, marked Last used.

> Good to know: An Admin account has no renter portal: My rentals is not offered, and `carmacars.ca/account` opens Admin. The renter profile and its bookings stay on file under **People** > **Renters**.',
